    "Checkpoint load": "vLLM L2 reload_weights HTTP step; includes layerwise checkpoint iteration/load.",
    "KV-cache remap": "vLLM L2 wake of the KV-cache tag.",
    "Disk read + hash + H2D pipeline": "Exact-disk overlapped pipeline wall time; read, hash, and H2D overlap and therefore are not stacked separately.",
    "Control overhead": "Residual required to reconcile disjoint phase times to the measured total."
  },
